# The build context is bootc/, shared by fedora and almalinux: send only what this
# Containerfile reads, so that discover rebuilds it only when that changes:
# fedora's policy check, shared files and signature checks, not its
# Containerfile or versions.
# BuildKit reads this file, named after the Containerfile, before
# any bootc/.dockerignore (bootc/REFERENCES.md, "Shared build context").
*
!almalinux/geoblock.nu
!almalinux/test_geoblock.nu
!almalinux/sysroot
!almalinux/test
!fedora/policy.jq
!fedora/sysroot/common
!fedora/test/signature.yaml
!k3s/install.sh
!k3s/sysroot
!k3s/test
